# Taskfile

Local commands live in root `Taskfile.yml` ([Task](https://taskfile.dev/)). Do **not** add a Makefile, justfile, or npm scripts for cargo/docker.

```bash
task              # same as task check
task check        # sequential fmt, clippy, test, deny
task coverage     # cargo llvm-cov --fail-under-lines 80 (≥80% lines; ignore **/main.rs)
task docker       # docker build -t ollama-router:local .
task --list
```

`check` must stay sequential (`cmds` + `task:`). Do not use Task `deps:` for cargo steps — they run in parallel and contend on `target/`.

CI in `.woodpecker/verify.yml` runs `cargo` / `docker` directly. Do not install `task` in Woodpecker CI.

Ignore `.task/` (checksum cache).
